(Head-head moving TCP validation sequence)
(The tool-tip path and the tool orientation both change.)
(Use this after the fixed-tip TCP validation passes.)
G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G61 G80 G90 G94
G0 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B0.000 C0.000
M0 (Start moving TCP validation)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B0.000 C0.000 F1200.0 (start home)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for start home)
G1 X1650.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B45.000 C0.000 F1200.0 (linear X with B tilt)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for linear X with B tilt)
G1 X1650.000 Y1000.000 Z-600.000 B45.000 C90.000 F1200.0 (linear Y with C swivel)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for linear Y with C swivel)
G1 X1500.000 Y1000.000 Z-550.000 B0.000 C90.000 F1200.0 (return X with Z raise)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for return X with Z raise)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-550.000 B-45.000 C180.000 F1200.0 (combined B/C rotation)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for combined B/C rotation)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B0.000 C0.000 F1200.0 (return home)
M0 (Observe TCP motion for return home)
M2
